{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"alias":"improbable-crimson-hare","creation_channel":"mcp","description":"## Context / Problem\nThe tests/scripts cohort contains audited comments or docstrings that obscure current behavior with repetition, obvious narration, duplicated explanation, or historical detail. The audit is pinned to `9e65567b79ffe872534c3c656ade7b34340d8192`.\n\n## Approach\nEdit explanatory text only in this directory/subsystem cohort. Condense it to current, non-obvious rationale and constraints; retain every file-specific preserve item and consumer contract below. Grouping adjacent files from one subsystem keeps the change reviewable in one session and permits one coherent verification pass without changing executable behavior.\n\n## Scope\n- `tests/scripts/conftest.py:1-6, 32-35, 74-81, 111-131` — Preserve import-path necessity, capture contract, and network isolation. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/scripts/test_alert_dedup.py:1-12, 95-102` — Preserve lane-specific marker namespaces and string timestamp acceptance. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/scripts/test_autodeploy_disk_pressure.py:1-16, 291-293, 405-460` — Preserve quiescent-tick reclaim, measured before/after logging, persistence-only alerting, and distinct marker tokens. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/scripts/test_autodeploy_fetch_secrets.py:1-17` — Preserve secret refresh-before-compose ordering and failure stop. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/scripts/test_autodeploy_health_gate.py:1-15, 170-175, 246-255` — Preserve deadline-above-app budget, pre-rollback stderr capture, and marker-injection protection. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/scripts/test_autodeploy_materialize_certbot.py:1-16` — Preserve installer-source trigger and host timer materialization. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/scripts/test_autodeploy_materialize_probe.py:1-14` — Preserve observability source-to-host-copy trigger. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/scripts/test_autodeploy_mcp_bluegreen.py:1-18, 510-521, 650-658, 692-698, 1622-1672, 1700-1764, 1997-2004, 2144-2153, 2333-2341, 2477-2490` — Preserve atomic cutover, component-scoped backoff/accounting, safe image retention, handshake/store readiness, and unconditional live-backend protection. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/scripts/test_autodeploy_review_drain.py:1-20, 296-301, 346-353, 443-464, 489-501, 637-712` — Preserve busy/mid-redeploy deferral, bounded episode semantics, signal-unavailable fail-open behavior, and observability markers. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/scripts/test_autodeploy_signals_gerrit_config.py:1-24, 41-44` — Preserve detect-only/manual-apply classification and operator-facing detail. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/scripts/test_autodeploy_signals_nginx_edge.py:1-22, 62-64` — Preserve detect-only manual apply for the edge template. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/scripts/test_autodeploy_signals_nginx_materializer.py:1-29` — Preserve materializer-source detection and manual-apply classification. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/scripts/test_binding_lifecycle_grace_seam_clean_heldout.py:1-29, 116-119` — Preserve zero below-seam reads and live grace wiring. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/scripts/test_canary_bridge.py:1-30` — Preserve immediate drift alerting versus thresholded heartbeat alerting. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/scripts/test_check_adr_numbers.py:1-27` — Preserve ADR/marker bijection and duplicate-number detection. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/scripts/test_check_config_ownership_heldout.py:1-12, 44-46, 84-86, 130-132, 150-152, 177-179, 189-191, 203-205, 246-248` — Preserve adversarial detection shapes and real-tree cleanliness. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/scripts/test_check_config_ownership.py:1-19` — Preserve approved ownership seams and fail-closed classification. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/scripts/test_check_config_reads_heldout.py:110-119, 243-247, 272-277, 322-333` — Preserve negative string-read fixtures and closed-ticket marker reporting. Consumer: none found.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Every listed location contains only current, non-obvious rationale or constraints after remediation; verified by reviewing the final diff against every Scope row.\n- [ ] Every preserve item and consumer contract in Scope remains explicit and accurate; verified by a row-by-row completion comment and the commands under Verification.\n- [ ] No executable behavior or test assertion changes; verified by the commands under Verification exiting 0.\n\n## Verification\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" make lint`\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" .venv/bin/python scripts/check_comment_hygiene.py`\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" pytest tests/scripts/conftest.py tests/scripts/test_alert_dedup.py tests/scripts/test_autodeploy_disk_pressure.py tests/scripts/test_autodeploy_fetch_secrets.py tests/scripts/test_autodeploy_health_gate.py tests/scripts/test_autodeploy_materialize_certbot.py tests/scripts/test_autodeploy_materialize_probe.py tests/scripts/test_autodeploy_mcp_bluegreen.py tests/scripts/test_autodeploy_review_drain.py tests/scripts/test_autodeploy_signals_gerrit_config.py tests/scripts/test_autodeploy_signals_nginx_edge.py tests/scripts/test_autodeploy_signals_nginx_materializer.py tests/scripts/test_binding_lifecycle_grace_seam_clean_heldout.py tests/scripts/test_canary_bridge.py tests/scripts/test_check_adr_numbers.py tests/scripts/test_check_config_ownership_heldout.py tests/scripts/test_check_config_ownership.py tests/scripts/test_check_config_reads_heldout.py`\n\nThe row-by-row diff review is authoritative for prose quality; the hygiene guard detects only its narrow deterministic history-token rule.","id":"ee26-7644-3948-40d5","parent_id":"2d43-3c39-307e-4450","priority":3,"repos":["rebar"],"tag